Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:02.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Antibiotic ka course\Npoora kiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.15,0:00:04.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Toh jalan\Nabhi bhi kyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:05.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Kyunki H. pylori
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}saalon tak\Naapki lining\Nkhaata raha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.57,0:00:13.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Antibiotic ne\Nbacteria hata diya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:14.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Sahi kiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:17.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Par jo lining\Nusne khaayi,\Nwoh wahi rahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Isiliye\Ncourse ke baad bhi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}jalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:23.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Do course.\NTeen test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:25.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Phir bhi\Nwahi pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:28.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Socho:\Ncourse khatam,\Naur pet bhi shaant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:30.72,CapTop,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Usi lining pe\NTumGard\Nkaam karta hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.77,0:00:35.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Kalonji\Naur licorice\Nlining ko\Nsupport karte hain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.69,0:00:38.65,CapTop,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Doctor ki dawa\Napna kaam kare,\NTumGard apna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:42.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Chai band nahi.\NBas aadha chammach\Nlunch ke baad,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:44.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}aadha dinner ke baad.\N60 din.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:48.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Log report karte hain:\Npehle hafte mein\Nkhane ke baad wali\Njalan kam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.94,0:00:52.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Aur aap\Nakele shuru nahi karoge.\NFounder ka seedha email,
